#: kcmsambaimports.cpp:51
msgid "Mounted under"
msgstr "Монтирано како"

#: kcmsambaimports.cpp:53
msgid ""
"This list shows the Samba and NFS shared resources mounted on your system fro"
"m other hosts. The \"Type\" column tells you whether the mounted resource is "
"a Samba or an NFS type of resource. The \"Resource\" column shows the descrip"
"tive name of the shared resource. Finally, the third column, which is labeled"
" \"Mounted under\" shows the location on your system where the shared resourc"
"e is mounted."
msgstr ""
"This list shows the Samba and NFS shared resources mounted on your system fro"
"m other hosts. The \"Type\" column tells you whether the mounted resource is "
"a Samba or an NFS type of resource. The \"Resource\" column shows the descrip"
"tive name of the shared resource. Finally, the third column, which is labeled"
" \"Mounted under\" shows the location on your system where the shared resourc"
"e is mounted."

